/** abstract.typ
 *
 * Fill in the English abstract of your thesis in this file. The
 * preamble is imported, in case you wish to use commands defined
 * there.
 *
***/

#pdf.attach(
  "abstract.typ",
  relationship: "source",
  mime-type: "text/vnd.typst",
  description: "Typst source code for the English abstract of this thesis.",
)

#import "../preamble.typ": *

The abstract is a concise, self-containing description of
the work: what was the problem, what was done, and what
are the results. Do not include charts or tables in the
abstract. In Bachelor's and Master's theses the abstract
length is restricted to 1 page, but in Licentiate and
Doctoral theses the abstract is allowed to be longer. Place
the abstract in the primary language of your thesis first
followed by its translation, if required. International
students do not need to include an abstract in Finnish.
